    "answer": "G-Retriever 的机制在给定证据中未被描述，无法比较，流程证据不足。Tree-of-Traversals 维护并反复扩展局部 KG 子图，属于子图选择：它“maintains a local KG subgraph that is repeatedly expanded until it contains all the information required by an LLM to answer the given query”[chunk_0cb3c2dcbacf18237a13b232366d2be8]。其搜索边界由树搜索定义，包括“termination condition when an answer is found”[chunk_0cb3c2dcbacf18237a13b232366d2be8]；算法在“the LLM is able to answer the original query using the local KG subgraph as context”时停止[chunk_0cb3c2dcbacf18237a13b232366d2be8]。CuriousLLM 的搜索边界是证据充分后的提前终止：微调模型在“it has gathered sufficient evidence”时生成终止信号“NA”[chunk_1c31546f7f4375c1f684f59dc4fa0521]。其证据缺口信号表现为“asks follow-up questions to more efficiently guide the search toward missing evidence”[chunk_d911a73017c3747c65463e9c0b9e089d]。因此，在给定证据中，子图选择只见于 Tree-of-Traversals；搜索边界见于 CuriousLLM 与 Tree-of-Traversals；证据缺口信号明确见于 CuriousLLM。G-Retriever 的相关机制缺少直接引句支持。",
